+<a id="ctxcrewgate--crewgate"></a>
+
+### `ctx.crewGate` — `CrewGate`
+
+The Crew gate service. One operation per ask; nothing is cached, so a refusal upstream is a refusal here on the next call.
+
+```ts cordis-catalog
+/**
+ * Refuse before any network call: the body check the Netie client runs
+ * ahead of POST, so a permissive vault cannot be greenwashed from here.
+ * @param ask - the ids-only ask.
+ */
+refuse(ask: GateAsk): void
+
+/**
+ * Ask OpenVault. Resolves with the stripped reply only on `allowed: true`.
+ * @param ask - the ids-only ask.
+ * @param signal - caller cancellation, fused with the transport timeout.
+ * @returns the reply with body keys dropped.
+ */
+async allow(ask: GateAsk, signal?: AbortSignal): Promise<Record<string, unknown>>
+```
+
+Source: [`packages/guard/crew-gate/src/index.ts`](../../packages/guard/crew-gate/src/index.ts)
